RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.70); optionally Enzyme toolchain for autodiff
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
